# The website's own assets. The blanket *.svg and *.txt rules above would otherwise
# swallow them: they were tracked under website/public/ from before those rules existed,
# and git's grandfathering is tied to the path, so the move to apps/ made them invisible.
!apps/website/public/*.svg
!apps/website/public/*.txt
